{"unit_id":"runfali__dsh-skill-curator#card-zh","repo":"runfali/dsh-skill-curator","commit":"37c17e4acc6b0b3832cb025c3e81a64eefa9a06b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-curator 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的自动技能策展插件。它按对话轮数触发后台评审子代理，并提供手动评审命令。评审读取会话摘要后，可创建、修改、合并或整理本机 SKILL.md；技能库工具还支持读取、备份、生命周期归档与恢复。插件记录技能使用状态，并可在设置允许时归档长期未用技能。适合希望把日常经验沉淀到本机技能库的 DSH 用户。默认跟随当前模型；自定义评审端点和 API key 均为可选配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:281-320","src/skill-tools.js:483-505","src/settings.js:27-60"]}
{"unit_id":"runfali__dsh-skill-curator#card-en","repo":"runfali/dsh-skill-curator","commit":"37c17e4acc6b0b3832cb025c3e81a64eefa9a06b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-skill-curator reviews DSH conversation digests in a background subagent or via /skill-refine. It can create, edit, and organize local SKILL.md files, back them up, track use, and archive or restore skills. Reviews use the current model by default; a custom endpoint and API key are optional.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:281-320","src/skill-tools.js:483-505","src/settings.js:27-60"]}
